<div class="article_content content" id="7681286_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[Added <span class="legref" data-ref=""><span class="hisdate">8-6-2018</span> by <span class="loclaw">Ord. No. 30</span></span>.51.18<a class="footnoteref" href="#ft7681286-1" id="ref7681286-1">[1]</a>]</div><div class="footnotes"><div class="footnote" id="ft7681286-1"><a class="footnoterefnum" href="#ref7681286-1">[1]</a><div class="ftpara">Editor's Note: This ordinance also provided for the repeal of former Art. XIA, Vacant Building Registry, added 2-7-2000 by Ord. No. 51.82.98, as amended.</div></div></div></div>


