  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-33588564" data-guid="33588564"></div>
        <div id="questions-33588564" data-guid="33588564" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="33588564_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Any person violating any provision of the Vacant Building Registry or providing false information to the enforcement officer shall be punished as provided by Chapter <a class="xref" guid="7681471" href="7681471#7681471">133A</a> of this Code.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

            </div>
          </div>
        </main>
